# DEV-45, SP-22 (b), as corrected by the security fix to dilla-media task 9: a member's own Remove
# and the instance's Remove of the same call leaf, in both orders, followed by another member's
# commit. A member proposal never cancels, voids, blocks or stands in for an instance proposal.
#
# Order 1, the instance first: carol is kicked, then tries to leave. The delivery service refuses
# her own Remove because the instance's is pending; the leave verb reads that as "I am being
# removed" and withdraws it. The call stays frozen until alice commits the instance's Remove.
#
# Order 2, the member first: dave posts his own Remove, then is kicked. The instance issues its
# Remove on top of his — the call freezes, which a member Remove never does — and alice's commit
# is accepted. That acceptance is the two-Removes-of-one-leaf check: OpenMLS keeps only the later
# of two Removes of one leaf in alice's proposal store, so her commit references the instance's
# (clause 1 refuses a commit that omits it) and leaves dave's unreferenced, which clause 1 allows,
# and the instance's PublicGroup stages a commit that references one of the two.
#
# "Out" is checked through the instance, not by the leaver sending: a client holding its own
# pending Remove cannot create an application message (OpenMLS refuses with PendingProposal). A
# repeated kick of a device that still held a leaf would leave a Remove outstanding and the send
# after it would answer 425; a kick of a device that is gone is dropped, and the send goes through.
instance dilla
client alice
client bob
client carol
client dave
group call kind=call target=e2e2e2e2e2e2e2e2e2e2e2e2e2e2e2e2 community=none creator=alice
join bob call via=external
sync alice
join carol call via=external
sync alice
sync bob
join dave call via=external
sync alice
sync bob
sync carol
kick alice carol
leave carol call
expect_425 send alice call carol's own remove did not lift the freeze
commit alice call
sync bob
sync dave
kick alice carol
send alice call carol is out after order one
expect_decrypts bob call carol is out after order one
leave dave call
kick alice dave
expect_425 send alice call the kick is issued over dave's own remove
commit alice call
sync bob
kick alice dave
send alice call carol and dave are out
expect_decrypts bob call carol and dave are out
